<TXSPN>―From Motoki Station on the local line to Sawa-<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="みなかみ">Minakami</STYLE> Station, and then connecting on the all-stops bullet train―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eventually, I arrived in Tokyo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I got off the train, the air, so different from Motoki-cho's, made it hard to breathe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If even one of eat, sleep, breathe is held down, I panic.<PG>
To calm myself, I took a deep breath for just 3 seconds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Actually, this is my first time coming to Tokyo.<PG>
