{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It'll probably be internet cafe life for a while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have more than enough money for that.<PG>
But before that... 
{PAUSE ""}
I was hungry...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me, with a survival instinct more sensitive than most people's, filling an empty stomach matters more than anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
First, I'll go somewhere I can eat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somewhere as cheap as possible, with big portions.<PG>
While I was on the bullet train, I'd memorized the route map to some extent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I got on a random local line and got off at a random station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
