{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A wave of people that someone as small as me would have a pretty hard time swimming across.<PG>
I'll slip off onto a side street for a bit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I turned into a narrow street, a certain shop caught my eye, and I stopped.<PG>
