{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Sorry to keep you waiting! The 10kg curry, time limit 60 minutes!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While I was looking at the TV shoot, a super-large curry was set down in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that moment, the TV crew started buzzing.<PG>
Whatever they're making a fuss about, it has nothing to do with me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Itadakimasu, I said in my heart, and plunged my spoon into the curry.<PG>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Mm, delicious!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't just curry. Fried chicken, a cutlet, and raw vegetables like a salad were on it too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sauce was well spiced and rich, yet without much of a peculiar edge, so it was a taste I wouldn't tire of.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\カレー屋カウンター.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, a man came over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh, I'm with Japonica TV. Would it be all right if we filmed you eating, just for a little bit?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Japonica TV, if I remember right, was the biggest private TV station in Japan.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\カレー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
