{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\カレー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Honestly, eating while being watched made me uneasy, but if I was going to live somewhere as crowded as Tokyo, I'd better get used to it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I paid it no mind and kept eating.<PG>
"Here, a <STYLE ID="5">petite girl</STYLE> is taking on the 10kg curry!
{PAUSE ""}
