{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ignoring the crew's commentary, I kept bringing curry to my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I may come off as unfriendly for TV, but I'm the one letting them film me as a favor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than anything, I want to focus on the ritual of satisfying my instinct's demands.<PG>
That said, this is Tokyo curry for you.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The more I ate, the hungrier I got. My pace rose, and my stomach worked harder and harder.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="5">Her</STYLE> pace isn't slowing down one bit!
{PAUSE ""}
　What do you think, Champion <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="みなみざき">Minamizaki</STYLE>-san!?"
