{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Put the other way around, since I can't control it, the muscles around the esophagus are bound to tire out.<PG>
If my <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="えんげ">swallowing</STYLE> power drops, my speed will suffer too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Training <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="そしゃく">chewing</STYLE> power and <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="えんげ">swallowing</STYLE> power takes a fair amount of time, and there's no time left for that now.
{PAUSE ""}
